  m_Name: ArcadeGameWindrow
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  Mode: 122
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Windrow
  Description: 'Rhinos only, and an empty cell to fill. Every row of trail you lay that is still
    standing when the clock runs out is your score. Your plough breaks nothing it hits, but
    a prism it throws into another destroys both - so fly along a rival''s row and throw it
    into itself. Mass throws further, and the triggers steer the throw: hold one and
    everything goes that way. Mass crystals are scarcer at higher intensities; at Mass 5
    every prism you plough lands shielded, so you can bank your own rows into armour. When
    the clock runs out, the team with the most standing wins.'
